    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Danmaku Girl\u200b</strong>\u200b is a puzzle-centric 2D platformer that blends platform-jumping and bullet-shooting elements. Players must conquer 40+ levels by strategically selecting and combining 11 danmaku skills, leveraging environmental interactions, analyzing enemy attack patterns, and overcoming diverse terrain challenges to successfully clear each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In search of her missing dog, the girl Sibi unexpectedly becomes entangled in a crisis threatening the world's survival. On this journey filled with unknowns, she will harness the mysterious power of &quot;Danmaku&quot;\u2014freely combining various Danmaku abilities to navigate intricate terrains and outmaneuver formidable foes. Each choice and combination of abilities will determine whether she can overcome adversity and find her lost companion...</p>",
